WEBVTT

00:05.043 --> 00:07.170
- So, what time is your flight?
- Eight a.m.

00:07.345 --> 00:09.677
Eight a. M? Wow.

00:10.248 --> 00:12.011
Yup.

00:12.183 --> 00:14.708
- You want me to drive you?
- That'd be nice.

00:15.353 --> 00:17.685
What time do you think
we should leave? Around 6?

00:17.856 --> 00:19.551
- To be on the safe side.
- Sure.

00:19.724 --> 00:23.626
Sure. You never know with traffic
and airport security and all.

00:24.662 --> 00:28.189
- Would you rather I call a cab?
- No, no. No, I won't hear of it.

00:28.366 --> 00:29.958
I'll call one for you.

00:31.803 --> 00:33.771
Golly, I'm gonna miss you.

00:33.972 --> 00:35.906
A couple days without sex
won't kill you.

00:36.074 --> 00:37.769
It's not just sex.

00:37.976 --> 00:41.036
You're my friend, my companion.

00:41.212 --> 00:43.737
And what makes you think
I'm not gonna have sex?

00:44.849 --> 00:46.180
Excuse me?

00:46.351 --> 00:49.081
Hey, when the cat's away,
the mice masturbate.

00:51.289 --> 00:53.883
Tell you what, why don't you
open a bottle of wine...

00:54.059 --> 00:57.392
...come upstairs, and I'll give the mice
something to remember me by.

00:57.562 --> 00:59.462
Oh, yay, fresh memories.

01:00.899 --> 01:03.265
Much better than the video of you
on my iPhone.

01:05.503 --> 01:07.596
You took video of me on your iPhone?

01:07.772 --> 01:10.570
Well, uh, just a little.

01:10.742 --> 01:14.303
I'd have asked permission,
but you were kind of busy.

01:14.779 --> 01:17.111
- Give me the phone.
- Aww.

01:17.282 --> 01:19.079
Give it.

01:20.385 --> 01:22.080
Thank you.

01:23.555 --> 01:27.582
- Oh, Charlie.
- What? You can't even tell it's you.

01:28.426 --> 01:30.360
Boy, I can't turn my back on you,
can I?

01:30.528 --> 01:33.326
Actually, I have photographic evidence
that you can.

01:34.399 --> 01:37.334
- Not anymore.
- Aww.

01:37.702 --> 01:41.001
Don't pout.
Just get the wine and come upstairs.

01:41.172 --> 01:43.504
- Okay.
- And leave the phone down here.

01:43.908 --> 01:45.102
Aww.

01:48.046 --> 01:53.074
Let's see, what's the proper wine
for the occasion?

01:53.251 --> 01:56.277
Oh, who cares?
Everything goes with ass biting.

01:57.555 --> 01:58.886
Hey.

01:59.457 --> 02:02.483
- I thought you were on a date.
- I was.

02:02.660 --> 02:04.252
- Didn't go well.
- Really?

02:04.429 --> 02:07.227
You're usually such a hit
with the ladies.

02:07.398 --> 02:10.629
This might've been the worst date
of my life.

02:10.802 --> 02:14.329
Did she dress you in a leather bustier
and tie you to a bed?

02:14.506 --> 02:16.633
- No.
- Did she superglue a model car...

02:16.808 --> 02:18.070
...to your balls?

02:19.377 --> 02:21.641
- No.
- She talk you into putting on a dress...

02:21.813 --> 02:24.805
...while she stole your wallet?
- No.

02:24.983 --> 02:27.713
Then this wasn't even
your worst date this month.

02:28.386 --> 02:29.444
I suppose.

02:29.621 --> 02:31.748
And thanks for the highlight reel,
by the way.

02:31.923 --> 02:33.015
Happy to help.

02:33.191 --> 02:37.719
I feel like going down to the beach,
and diving into the ocean...

02:37.896 --> 02:40.490
...and swimming out
until my arms are so tired...

02:40.665 --> 02:43.657
...that I sink below the waves
into blessed oblivion.

02:43.835 --> 02:48.329
Hold on. Before you do anything crazy,
can you help me get this bottle open?

02:48.506 --> 02:51.168
Sure. I mean,
these women you meet online...

02:51.342 --> 02:54.436
...you think you have some kind
of a connection, a bond.

02:54.612 --> 02:56.477
Then you meet them
and there's nothing.

02:56.648 --> 02:59.208
Just two lonely strangers staring
at each other...

02:59.384 --> 03:02.080
...across buffalo wings
and soft-serve ice cream.

03:02.620 --> 03:06.351
Well, maybe your problem is taking them
to a mall food court on a first date.

03:07.358 --> 03:09.155
I don't wanna make
a big investment...

03:09.327 --> 03:11.693
...until I have a sense
of where things are going.

03:11.863 --> 03:13.990
Plus, the parking is free.

03:14.165 --> 03:15.189
There you go.

03:15.366 --> 03:17.027
Thank you.

03:17.202 --> 03:19.227
Okay, well, good catching up.

03:19.404 --> 03:22.532
If you're going for that swim,
tuck your license in your crack...

03:22.707 --> 03:25.073
...so I can identify your body.

03:28.079 --> 03:31.708
I mean, is it so much to ask to make a
connection with another human being?

03:31.883 --> 03:33.748
- No.
- I'm not even looking for sex.

03:33.918 --> 03:37.285
- I just want a little companionship.
- That's rough. Buy a dog.

03:37.455 --> 03:42.415
- You said I couldn't have a dog.
- Fine, buy a dog and move.

03:42.594 --> 03:46.496
You know what would be great? If you
could find a dog with its own house.

03:47.532 --> 03:49.329
What's taking you so long?

03:49.500 --> 03:51.627
Oh, hi, Alan. How was your date?

03:51.803 --> 03:54.601
- Awful.
- I'm sorry. You wanna talk about it?

03:54.772 --> 03:56.467
No, he's going for a swim.

03:57.775 --> 04:00.608
- Well, I could use a friendly ear.
- Of course.

04:00.778 --> 04:03.941
Now, tell me,
this is the girl you met online?

04:04.115 --> 04:06.413
- "Perky Dodger fan in Tarzana."
- What happened?

04:06.584 --> 04:10.111
First of all, she wasn't so much perky
as porky.

04:10.288 --> 04:12.017
More like a Dodger Dog fan.

04:12.190 --> 04:14.454
Don't you hate when people
misrepresent themselves?

04:14.626 --> 04:18.084
When someone makes a date with "buff
Malibu doctor," that's what they get.

04:18.263 --> 04:20.288
- That's because you're honest.
To a fault.

04:20.465 --> 04:24.094
Apparently, even when the cat's here,
the mice have to masturbate.

04:36.314 --> 04:37.508
Hey.

04:37.682 --> 04:39.172
Hey.

04:39.951 --> 04:41.441
Watching some football?

04:41.619 --> 04:43.746
No fooling you.

04:47.892 --> 04:51.020
- Who are we rooting for?
- The spread.

04:54.065 --> 04:57.762
Ah. So we're making an illegal wager?

04:58.336 --> 04:59.701
Technically.

04:59.904 --> 05:02.168
Don't get me wrong, I'm not judging.

05:02.340 --> 05:04.638
It's really a victimless crime,
don't you think?

05:08.846 --> 05:10.074
So far.

05:13.685 --> 05:15.482
Sorry.

05:20.291 --> 05:22.623
Heard any good jokes lately?

05:23.528 --> 05:24.995
Yeah.

05:25.163 --> 05:27.961
Two brothers are sitting on a couch.

05:29.167 --> 05:31.658
One of them says,
"Heard any good jokes lately?"

05:31.836 --> 05:33.565
And then the other one... Get this.

05:33.738 --> 05:36.707
