05:45.917 --> 05:49.683
- Okay, we'll just watch the game.
- Thank you.

05:51.356 --> 05:53.950
All right. It's a commercial.
Now you can talk.

05:55.326 --> 05:57.055
I was thinking,
with Chelsea out of town...

05:57.228 --> 06:01.221
Hold on, hold on. It's that baby
that trades stocks. Heh, heh.

06:01.766 --> 06:04.030
I love this kid.

06:04.902 --> 06:08.167
There it is. Wow.

06:11.209 --> 06:12.642
Okay, go ahead.

06:14.612 --> 06:16.773
I was thinking,
with Chelsea out of town...

06:17.415 --> 06:20.077
