after the game...

06:20.251 --> 06:23.049
...you and I could go out
and grab a bite to eat.

06:23.621 --> 06:25.179
No, thanks.

06:25.356 --> 06:28.223
- Not hungry?
- Don't like you.

06:28.926 --> 06:31.394
Oh, come on.
I need some human contact.

06:32.797 --> 06:35.823
That's probably a human.
Go contact them.

06:39.604 --> 06:40.935
That was clever.

06:41.105 --> 06:42.766
I'm a clever guy.

06:44.609 --> 06:48.705
Hey, buddy, you're here early. I was
thinking if you're hungry, you and l...

06:50.114 --> 06:51.342
Maybe later.

06:52.116 --> 06:54.584
He's been crabby
since his girlfriend dumped him.

06:54.752 --> 06:57.277
The kid's a stone-cold bummer, Alan.

06:58.289 --> 07:00.257
Okay, well,
thanks for dropping him off.

07:00.425 --> 07:02.689
- You're welcome.
- Oh, hey, Herb.

07:02.860 --> 07:06.091
By any chance, do you wanna go out
and maybe grab a bite?

07:06.264 --> 07:09.097
- Really? You and me?
- Sure, why not?

07:09.634 --> 07:13.035
It's kind of weird, isn't it?
You're the ex-husband, I'm the current.

07:13.204 --> 07:14.831
So we've got something in common.

07:15.406 --> 07:17.499
- We do, don't we?
- Right.

07:17.675 --> 07:19.905
Neither one of us
is having sex with Judith.

07:24.282 --> 07:26.546
That's actually a little too close
to home.

07:27.318 --> 07:29.218
Sorry. So, what do you think?

07:29.921 --> 07:31.980
- I could eat.
- Let's go.

07:32.156 --> 07:34.021
You ever been to Kabob Kingdom?

07:34.192 --> 07:36.558
At the food court? I love that place.

07:38.796 --> 07:41.162
- Hey, Berta, would you grab me a beer?
- Sure.

07:41.332 --> 07:44.665
- Jake, grab your uncle a beer.
- Let him get it himself.

07:44.836 --> 07:46.895
