you need a lot of kid-friendly jokes.

09:34.178 --> 09:37.306
Sometimes when I use the little reflex
hammer, I pretend I'm an Indian.

09:37.481 --> 09:39.779
Hai, hai, hai, hai!

09:40.918 --> 09:44.012
